WEBVTT

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.020
Almost there!

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.270
Good work, jamo!

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:12.010
Let's take a break, jamo.

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:14.680
Thank you!

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.140
The big village close 
to us is Uruka Village.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.460
It's where we're going, jamo.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.960
We're not going to the village next to it?

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:30.080
I went there once to sell things, 
jamo, but they didn't want me there.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.790
Years ago in Uruka Village,

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.460
the mayor's oldest son 
changed their policies, jamo.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:40.500
He imported technology
 and cultural advancements,

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.970
and in a short while made
 it much bigger, jamo!

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:47.490
He's amazing! What's his name?

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.310
A m-monster!

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:01.580
Yuu-san, time to use your healing magic!

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.370
I can't just do it any 
time I'm asked, you know!

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:17.320
Are you okay?

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:22.340
The monsters have been on edge lately.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:29.080
He's surprised at what a 
wimp you are, Yuu-san.

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:30.440
I'm not a wimp!

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:33.130
Oh, sorry.

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:34.930
That's not it...

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:39.340
Jamo! It's been a long time.

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:41.220
You know him?

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:42.550
Of course.

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:45.400
This is Harshut-sama, the mayor's eldest son,

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:48.050
and the man I was just
 telling you about, jamo.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:01.260
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:23.970
<b>The King of Dawn and the Imprisoned Bride</b>

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:26.430
Is it really okay for 
us to go to your house?

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.600
Of course.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:32.300
Healers have played a large part in 
making our village what it is today.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.000
Really?

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.630
There's still a few who aren't,

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:38.700
but most monsters in this 
area have been healed.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.520
That's made trade a lot easier.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.640
And...

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:46.040
There are some things I want 
to talk to Yuu-dono about.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:48.290
Nothing...

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:50.210
What's wrong?

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:58.260
Listen, mistress.

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:01.720
You're here on behalf of Arumu,
 and you need to

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:03.550
behave like a proper lady.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:07.440
Uruka Village is really fancy.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.850
There's so many people.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:10.990
Are you listening?

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:17.380
I am! I need to make this arranged marriage 
with the son of the village mayor a success

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.450
so that Uruku can help save Arumu, right?

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:21.560
That's correct.

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:23.150
Don't worry.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:27.070
I'll do my duty as the 
daughter of Arumu's mayor!

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:31.580
Oh, I hadn't finished 
carrying in your things.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.710
Please wait a little more.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:38.100
As soon as that's done, we will make 
formal introductions to Harshut-dono.

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:49.970
The daughter of Arumu's mayor 
arrived while you were gone.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.560
That's ahead of schedule.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:54.740
Belnar-dono, the watchdog 
of Arumu, is with her.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:55.890
I see.

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:58.720
Yes... They're in their room right now.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:02.590
By the way, who are these people?

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.610
You know at least one of them, right, Tennar?

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:05.980
Jamo the merchant.

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:08.320
And a pair of healers.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.790
Healers?

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:11.680
H-Hi...

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:13.180
I'm Merc!

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:18.800
I'll be going to hold some 
meetings in town, jamo!

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:23.620
Tennar, show them to their rooms.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:25.710
Of course, sir.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:31.430
It's wonderful!

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:34.420
Look, Yuu-san!

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:36.550
Look at this view!

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:40.810
It's said that veranda was once used

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:46.320
for trysts by lovers whose parents 
had forbidden them to meet.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.970
That's wonderful!

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:50.570
The more dangerous the love, the better!

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.580
Yuu-dono?

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:09.600
Nothing... I was just thinking, 
that's so romantic.

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.640
I'm glad you say so.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.830
I'll be going. I hope you enjoy yourselves.

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:23.090
Thanks for letting me hide here!

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:25.360
You don't have ears!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:28.410
Of course I don't. I came from the kingdom.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.450
The kingdom?!

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:32.160
Why were you hiding?

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:35.120
Is it forbidden love?

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:35.960
Hey, now...

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:38.040
The opposite, actually.

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.070
The opposite?

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:41.290
Yeah, the opposite...

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:48.880
I'm going to be forced to 
marry someone I don't like.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.280
Married?

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:56.810
For now I just hid,
but Belnar will be back soon.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.930
What should I do, you think?

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:01.310
You should...

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.320
I should?

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:06.990
You should think about trying to run away!

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.040
Run?

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.450
Merc!

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:13.770
Are you okay with her marrying 
someone she doesn't like?

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:16.110
I don't want that to happen!

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:19.480
But if I don't marry into Uruka Village,

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:22.300
it will cause problems 
for everyone in Arumu.

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:26.580
Maybe, but you can't do it like this!

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:31.590
Run away and think about it for a while.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:36.090
And if you're really willing to 
marry him, you can come back!

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.380
Thank you.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:40.340
You're right!

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:43.100
Yup!

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:48.140
Okay, I know we've just met,
 but can you help me?

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:49.160
Huh?

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:54.520
Will you take me away from here?

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:01.560
What's Harshut-dono thinking,

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:05.010
keeping her waiting and not 
even sending a welcome?!

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:09.040
And now he's with someone 
from the kingdom.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:15.760
Does he really intend to work with 
people who use such strange powers?

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:18.810
Are you okay?

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.610
You're too loud!

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:35.380
Where are they?

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:38.110
Big trouble, Harshut-sama!

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:41.490
The girl from Arumu has been kidnapped!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.630
I think that's far enough.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.310
I-I'm so tired.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.560
Are you okay?

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:58.090
People from the kingdom are weak, huh?

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:01.630
Yuu-san's always been a wimp.

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:04.010
I haven't introduced myself yet, have I?

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:06.240
My name is Lily Aru Kunu Arumu.

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:10.020
I'm the only daughter 
of Lilitoah, the mayor of Arumu.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.100
A m-monster!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:15.290
Oh, that's Mr. Fluffy.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.630
He's traveling with us.

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:20.960
And I'm Merc, the pretty girl in a bottle!

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:23.750
And this is Yuu-san, the healer!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.030
You're okay with traveling with a monster?

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:28.160
Is it because you're a healer?

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.510
It just followed us on its own.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:36.060
Anyway, we need to find a place 
where we won't be followed.

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:38.640
Hey, you three.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.710
We've been found already!

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:43.930
Is someone chasing you?

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.930
Y-Yeah...

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:48.320
Okay, want to come to my place?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.720
I can't believe I lost track of them!

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:56.820
Belnar-dono, calm down.

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:57.830
Calm down?!

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:02.360
What if she's crying for 
my help even as we speak?!

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:06.630
Lily-dono's capable of 
protecting herself, right?

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:09.840
I've taught her some sword techniques 
for self-defense, but...

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:12.940
It's the job of a doggarian 
woman to protect the home.

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:15.070
Fighting is a man's job.

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:16.270
Why?

00:10:16.270 --> 00:10:18.660
What's wrong with a woman fighting?

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:20.010
What are you talking about?

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:24.870
Women should be content with marrying a 
strong doggarian and being protected.

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.780
That's what will make my mistress happiest.

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:31.040
I disagree. Strongly.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:35.560
I challenge you to a duel,
 watchdog of Arumu.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:40.820
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:44.690
Why are we dueling?

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.700
I feel an arrogance in you!

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:48.930
Arrogance?

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:53.120
You think a girl who marries 
because old traditions

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:55.850
tell her she has to is 
going to be truly happy?!

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:00.380
Of course she will!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.420
Women are weak!

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:03.920
Men should protect them!

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:10.340
I'll tell you something...

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:13.390
I don't like you!

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:14.740
What a coincidence.

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:17.020
I never liked you, either.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:33.720
I'll tell you something else, Belnar-dono.

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:35.740
What?

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.710
You live out here?

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:43.030
Yes... I suppose I do.

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:45.550
Those nuts!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.800
They were in Uruka, too!

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:52.060
A monster!

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.220
It's a Garshan!

00:11:56.220 --> 00:11:58.500
It looks hurt.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:01.240
Yeah? Then we need to heal it.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.110
Can't you use your healing?

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:05.970
My "healing" doesn't heal wounds.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:14.540
Thanks for helping when I know 
you don't like monsters.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:17.260
Aw, I didn't really do anything...

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:19.750
It's okay now.

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:24.710
Belnar always told me that 
monsters were dangerous

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:27.170
and I needed to stay away from them.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.210
But in Uruka, you save them 
without hesitation, huh?

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:34.030
If you learn more about monsters, 
they won't scare you anymore.

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:37.530
All I know is what Belnar told me.

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:44.030
But Belnar-san only said that because 
he cares about you a lot, I think.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.520
Yeah...

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.290
Belnar is so nice.

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:49.980
But...

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.050
Lily-san?

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:54.860
I don't want to get married.

00:12:56.160 --> 00:13:00.050
No, I can't talk like that if I'm 
the mayor's daughter, can I?

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.900
I need to be feminine! Like the 
mayor's daughter should be!

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:07.550
Do you have to be feminine?

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.570
In the land of Wa,

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:15.310
they say there are flowers called 
"fireworks" that bloom in the sky.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:16.570
Flowers?

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:20.160
You charge a stone up with magic 
and shoot it up into the sky,

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.210
where it explodes into a flower.

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:26.430
Is that good for anything?

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:29.150
My dad said that, too.

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:34.900
But I want to see beautiful flowers 
blooming in the night sky.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:40.840
You're doing what you want 
to do, aren't you, Stito?

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:41.930
Yeah.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:46.460
But I'm sacrificing my village to do it.

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:51.420
What is it you want to do, Lily?

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.440
Mistress Lily!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.140
Where did Yuu-dono get off to?

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.970
The sun's setting. We need to hurry.

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:06.220
I know.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:12.310
There should be other Garshans around here.

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:14.670
I hope he gets better soon.

00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:16.580
Hey, Lily...

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:21.040
If you stay here, you can do what you 
want without being bothered by anyone.

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:24.220
If you don't want to 
get married, you can stay here.

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.120
Thank you.

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:30.910
But I like everyone in Arumu Village.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:34.560
I've always wanted to help them.

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:36.460
So...

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:38.380
I'll be going back.

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:39.440
I see.

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:43.070
So, when will the fireworks be done?

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:44.160
I don't know...

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:45.840
You're in no hurry, huh?

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:50.270
If only I had a container that 
could handle fire magic.

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:55.260
What about this nut shell, then?

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:58.920
Belnar was saying it's so hard to break, 
it could even withstand fire magic!

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:00.440
Try it!

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:02.630
Thank you...

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:07.500
Anyway, I need to get back.
 Belnar's probably worried.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:09.420
We'll go with you.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.010
No!

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.890
I need to go back first and 
tell them what happened,

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.340
or they'll think you kidnapped me!

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.730
Monsters?!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.190
They'll surround us!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.170
Let's run.

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:28.910
I'll go get Belnar!

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:30.580
Stay hidden until then.

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:36.770
He says he'll show you 
how to get back to town!

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:40.990
You won't know the way on your own, right?

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.850
Why not believe in him?

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:46.750
Help me, Garshan!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.150
Let's go!

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:51.950
This way!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:54.480
Wait!

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:14.040
Ow...

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:18.470
The monsters won't follow us here.

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:21.680
We were lucky to survive.

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:26.800
It's too high up for us 
to get out on our own.

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:30.120
I can't fly that high up, either.

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:34.290
What about the fire flowers?

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:36.720
That's right! Fireworks!

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.620
I have the ingredients.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.690
But...

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:45.100
No, I'll try it.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.920
Great!

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:49.790
Now what?!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:02.370
Belnar!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.820
Mistress!

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.810
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:06.830
Belnar!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.100
I'm so sorry I scared you!

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:11.530
Please save Yuu and his friends!

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:14.700
We saw him before?

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:18.880
Is this cave Mr. Merkiogre's lair?

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:23.350
Yuu-san, you have to do something!

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:29.170
See? You can do it if you try!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.230
Don't treat me like a kid!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.530
S-Stop it!

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:36.240
Mr. Fluffy is impressed, too!

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.430
I don't care about his opinion!

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:40.010
It's done!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.050
Get back!

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:54.330
What's that?

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:56.450
He finished it.

00:18:58.680 --> 00:19:02.210
I've been looking for you 
for so long, Stito.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:10.620
Harshut-sama,

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:13.840
about that alliance between us doggarians...

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.000
About that...

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:21.660
Is it possible for us to have 
an alliance without a marriage?

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:23.680
Neither of us wants to get married.

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:28.320
Sister, Jamo-san says 
he'll buy my fireworks.

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:30.360
Sister?

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:32.520
I'm sorry I didn't tell you before.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.040
I am Harshut Tofa Yakto Uruka.

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:39.080
The eldest daughter of Hakshut, 
mayor of Uruka village.

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:42.690
Daughter?

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:46.960
I'm so sorry, mistress!

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:48.770
I had no idea...

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:54.270
And so I don't think we'll be 
getting married after all.

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:57.210
I've heard you're quite good with a sword.

00:19:57.770 --> 00:20:00.090
Why don't we have a duel sometime?

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.140
Okay!

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:12.430
Thanks for saving my brother.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:18.310
N-No, thank you for saving us, Harshut-san.

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:21.220
Can you call me Harsh?

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:23.430
N-No reason...

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.640
It's my nickname.

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:30.610
I hope you'll come back to 
Uruka Village, Yuu-dono.

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:33.530
Okay, Harsh-san!

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:38.190
I'll be waiting!

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:46.480
I've heard that during spawning season,

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:49.010
monsters will try to protect 
themselves by forming packs.

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:53.020
Since I came to Uruka, I've learned a lot
 and realized I've made a lot of mistakes.

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:56.350
There's still so much I don't know.

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.110
So stay by my side forever, okay?

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:04.630
I'll always be there for you!

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:52.420
Mr. Fluffy seems to really like you!

00:22:54.570 --> 00:22:56.860
You want a new name?

00:22:56.860 --> 00:22:58.610
I was thinking that, too.

00:22:58.610 --> 00:22:59.770
What?!

00:23:00.340 --> 00:23:02.750
Then you think of a name, Yuu-san.

00:23:08.140 --> 00:23:09.860
How about Toto?

00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:12.860
It feels right.

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:16.230
It likes it?!

00:23:16.610 --> 00:23:19.380
But it's not cute at all!

00:23:19.380 --> 00:23:21.650
Come on. We're leaving, jamo.

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:23.590
Right. Toto it is.

00:23:25.490 --> 00:23:26.760
It's me, Titi!

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:27.520
It's me, Chacha!

00:23:27.520 --> 00:23:31.290
Did you see the doggarians' 
tails this episode?

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:32.860
You're so good at your job, Sis!

00:23:32.860 --> 00:23:35.340
You're telling them just 
what to watch out for!

00:23:35.340 --> 00:23:38.640
Next time: "The Tomboy Fairy and the 
Spring-Eating Dragon."

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>The Tomboy Fairy and the Spring-Eating Dragon (Part 1)</b>

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:40.640
It's part one!
